{"id":"662016014fa2492b0eb20be7d4e8c609394d10f2","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/57038","title":"2小时会议10分钟出纪要，但澜舟智会×LangClaw想解决的远不止于此 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"澜舟科技\n                  2026-08-11 17:30 分享","excerpt":"过去一年AI会议纪要产品层出不穷，但多停留在录音转写与摘要生成层面，缺乏会后跟进能力：待办事项无人自动分派、决议无法推动执行、信息不能无缝流转至下一环节，且纪要内容与团队知识库割裂，经验难以沉淀复用。根本症结在于现有工具仅作为“静态记录”，AI任务止步于生成，未延伸至执行闭环。澜舟智会则致力于打通会议全链路，实现从记录、提炼到任务分发、知识沉淀、执行追踪的一体化智能协同。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section id=\"js_content\" data-mpa-action-id=\"msmx941b1pc2\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w21t8\">过去一年，AI会议纪要产品出了一堆，录音转文字，自动出摘要，这些早就不是什么新鲜事。但它们都卡在一个地方——帮你记，也就如此了。那纪要生成完，待办谁跟进？决议谁执行？信息怎么流转到下一步？还是得靠人手动去拆、去分、去推。而且，纪要内容也无法和团队知识库互通，会议经验无法沉淀复用。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wcg0\">问题出在哪？会议软件只是一个给人看的记录工具，AI干完就收工，后面的活跟它没关系了。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w14bi\">我们做的事很简单：<span textstyle=\"\">把澜舟智会的会议能力“Skill”化，接入LangClaw企业数字员工平台，同时跟澜舟智库打通，以后随时能查</span>。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1hzl\">啥叫“Skill”化？简单说，就是把你开会要用的那些能力——会议分析、纪要生成、待办提取——打包成一个个标准化的“技能”，数字员工可以直接调用，不用人再中转。换句话说，会议软件不再只是给你看的，它更是给数字员工用的。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1lz0\">会议一结束，会议分析 Skill 就自动接手——提炼核心议题、决策结论和待办任务，把语音内容整理成结构化的数据，然后像接力棒一样，自动传给下一个数字员工。从\"听会\"到\"落地\"，一条链路打通，不用人再插手。</span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.525\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a640fac67710073a4bdeafc2e58340fa1786440608138.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a640fac67710073a4bdeafc2e58340fa1786440608138.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1ijt\">澜舟智会页面</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wl8z\">简单说，澜舟智会负责“听会”——把会议录音录像转成文字，理解内容、回答问题；LangClaw负责“干活”——把任务拆开、安排工具、执行落地。两者打通后，数字员工就不再只是简单跑跑流程，而是真正能把会议从头到尾处理完。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1e9s\">集成完成后，LangClaw便拥有了日常会议所需要的全部核心能力：</span></p></section><ol><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1l4l\"><span textstyle=\"\">音视频上传</span>：会议录音、录像直接上传，支持MP3、WAV、MP4等主流格式；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1r\"><span textstyle=\"\">转写稿生成</span>：AI 自动把录音录像转成文稿，准确率稳定在 95% 以上；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1oy1\"><span textstyle=\"\">会议纪要</span>：自动提取议题、落地决议、待办任务，条理清晰输出文档；；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wvjt\"><span textstyle=\"\">智能摘要</span>：再长的会议，也能一键提炼核心信息，三分钟就能读完整场会议重点；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wkne\"><span textstyle=\"\">说话人总结</span>：自动区分每位参会人发言，单独归纳每个人的核心观点；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wpgr\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI问答</span>：针对整场会议直接提问，比如 “客户对交付周期提出了哪些顾虑？”，AI 能立刻给出对应答案；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wb4v\"><span textstyle=\"\">声纹识别</span>：系统会根据每个人的声音特征自动识别到谁在说话，不用人工手动标注发言归属。</span></p></li></ol><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wcqo\">对团队而言，整个流程非常省心：会议结束后只需要上传音视频文件，剩下所有整理、复盘工作都交给数字员工处理。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5944444444444444\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8f8c0cc5b478ccaf6f1ec529225d24541786440608138.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8f8c0cc5b478ccaf6f1ec529225d24541786440608138.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><strong mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w109n\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx9sgv1tfl\" data-mpa-action-id=\"msmx9sh46vf\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">实际用起来什么样？拿几个常见场景走一遍</span></strong></p></section><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left;width: 0px;vertical-align: top;\" /></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">场景一：多模态技术讨论会——从“开完会还得手动整理”到“纪要待办一步到位”</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940woko\"><span textstyle=\"\">Step 1：在LangClaw中上传会议音视频文件</span></span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b7b717765787d41d5136228ef13085a61786440608138.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5009259259259259\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b7b717765787d41d5136228ef13085a61786440608138.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wjgq\">进入LangClaw 页面，在任务对话框上传视频文件，并发出指令“上传到智会并进行解析”。平台兼容市面上绝大多数音视频格式，不用提前转码。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1l0x\"><span textstyle=\"\">Step 2：系统自动解析生成完整转写稿</span></span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/207938f16bf40074c36552d45d305d1d1786440608138.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5148148148148148\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/207938f16bf40074c36552d45d305d1d1786440608138.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5388888888888889\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9dbe8becb44d35d46ac3e9fbced645721786440608138.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9dbe8becb44d35d46ac3e9fbced645721786440608138.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wtrq\">文件上传完成后，澜舟智会会自动启动解析工作。一场两小时时长的会议，5 到 10 分钟就能全部处理完毕。生成的文稿会区分不同发言人，每一段发言都附带精确到秒的时间戳，翻阅查看和普通文档一样。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1x6y\"><span textstyle=\"\">Step 3：自动生成会议纪要和智能摘要</span></span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6d5fcf0220cba44cce99b9e09222f2ab1786440608139.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5092592592592593\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6d5fcf0220cba44cce99b9e09222f2ab1786440608139.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d552564e19290c2429a82210201db17b1786440608139.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5046296296296297\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d552564e19290c2429a82210201db17b1786440608139.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/937abb3774805227ea775e4b7b1540cc1786440608139.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5120370370370371\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/937abb3774805227ea775e4b7b1540cc1786440608139.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5333333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6aa0287c2bea48dcd3904b44b750f2d51786440608139.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6aa0287c2bea48dcd3904b44b750f2d51786440608139.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1q7w\">转写流程结束，平台会同步输出两份文档：一份结构化会议纪要，清晰列明会议议题、达成决议、待办事项和对应负责人；另一份智能摘要，快速概括整场会议核心信息。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmxb4ux121x\" data-mpa-action-id=\"msmxb4v21p84\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span textstyle=\"\">场景二：业绩发布会——从“谁说了啥得反复回听”到“谁说了啥一目了然”</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w16p5\">这类会议发言的人多，信息密度大，光靠录音分不清谁说了什么。比如一场中国平安业绩发布会，管理层、分析师、媒体轮番发言，手动整理至少得半天。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1co9\"><span textstyle=\"\">升级智会 Skill 后</span>，还能自定义纪要模板及多格式（doc、Markdown、PDF），自动识别归类不同发言人内容，一键完成纪要生成、决议提取、知识库归档与任务联动，无需跨系统操作。还能灵活配置金融合规规则，快速产出清晰结构化纪要，大幅缩减人工整理成本。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1652\"><span textstyle=\"\">Step 1：说话人总结与声纹识别</span></span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5a2d22cd93155a89ce6917761a4bc3471786440608139.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5046296296296297\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5a2d22cd93155a89ce6917761a4bc3471786440608139.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5148148148148148\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/02910c72229a880be0bff0e05eb41cee1786440608139.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/02910c72229a880be0bff0e05eb41cee1786440608139.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1wbb\">上传文件后，系统能根据每个人的声音特征自动区分所有参会人员，单独汇总每个人的发言重点，同时展示各个人发言时长占比。不用手动标记，就能清晰分清每段发言是谁说的。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w163z\"><span textstyle=\"\">Step 2：智会skill针对会议内容直接进行AI问答</span></span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5046296296296297\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/344cdb4643400e1b17dc2e876e49549e1786440608139.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/344cdb4643400e1b17dc2e876e49549e1786440608139.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1500\">纪要有了，但事后想回查某个具体信息，翻文档还是费劲。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1wtx\">AI 问答最省时间——有任何疑问都可以直接提问，比如 “中国平安2022年上半年业绩怎样？，AI 会从整场会议内容里精准抓取对应信息，不用再反复翻录音、翻文稿了。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1h51\">而且接入LangClaw之后，AI问答的能力远不止“查单场会议”这么简单：</span></p></section><ul><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1x0s\"><span textstyle=\"\">问答范围突破单场会议限制</span>：能联动全量沉淀的会议知识库，跨多场业绩发布会调取上下文做综合推理问答；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1afi\"><span textstyle=\"\">支持自然语言下发复合问答指令</span>：自动联动任务、知识库等多 Skill 协同解答；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w2pp\"><span textstyle=\"\">可绑定行业校验规则</span>：金融类问答自动合规过滤、数据核验，适配业绩会专业问询场景；</span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wflw\"><span textstyle=\"\">问答结果可直接生成待办</span>：问答不再只是查内容，直接承接后续业务动作，比如把复盘片段写入系统。</span></p></li></ul><section><p><strong mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wu4\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmxjynu17bo\" data-mpa-action-id=\"msmxjyo5224s\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">对比下两种处理方式的不同</span></strong></p></section><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left;width: 0px;vertical-align: top;\" /></section><section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100030055\" data-ratio=\"0.4101851851851852\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/2a5dcc05d49ab0f38ffc265982274c8c1786440608140.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/2a5dcc05d49ab0f38ffc265982274c8c1786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w18io\">以往开完会，光是整理纪要就要占用大量工作时间，查找零散信息更是费时费力。接入这套组合方案之后，整套处理流程压缩到十分钟以内，团队不用再耗在重复性文字工作上，能把更多精力放在业务落地推进上。</span></p></section><section><p><strong mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wp4a\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmxk3311wbc\" data-mpa-action-id=\"msmxk33b1hyy\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">澜舟智库Skill化配置路径</span></strong></p></section><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left;width: 0px;vertical-align: top;\" /></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wq35\">配置起来也很简单——两种便捷方式，即可为LangClaw数字员工装上智能会议秘书能力。</span></p></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wvkm\"><span textstyle=\"\">配置方式一</span>：在澜舟智会产品首页获取配置命令，在LangClaw任务中复制该命令即可完成自动配置。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5398148148148149\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5a4b4a7531a6431c88bf175d7052abbf1786440608140.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5a4b4a7531a6431c88bf175d7052abbf1786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1j92\">澜舟智会：https://www.langboat.com/portal/minutes</span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/cbb9cc281d5580c89f35f0166dd5f40c1786440608140.webp\" data-w=\"300\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/cbb9cc281d5580c89f35f0166dd5f40c1786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wdau\">扫码体验澜舟智会👆</span></p></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1m5v\"><span textstyle=\"\">配置方式二</span>：前往澜舟智会用户中心复制「ZHIHUI_TOKEN」，随后，在LangClaw技能广场找到澜舟智会，并配置相关KEY，便可完成Skill配置。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ec09755c169a01cecee29a68194fecfa1786440608140.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5120370370370371\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ec09755c169a01cecee29a68194fecfa1786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d499a0ef2538ffb808a15cf58b0740231786440608140.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5416666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d499a0ef2538ffb808a15cf58b0740231786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5361111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e5970ac9a6dab26892b7f2fb30c269441786440608140.webp\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e5970ac9a6dab26892b7f2fb30c269441786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wlyg\">LangClaw：https://www.langboat.com/portal/langclaw</span></p></section><section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100030056\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/89b89da02bb6c38d474e2a4fc23f74991786440608140.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"300\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/89b89da02bb6c38d474e2a4fc23f74991786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w93w\">扫码体验LangClaw👆</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w1xsd\">AI办公这件事，已经过了比谁单点能力更强的阶段了。真正的差距，在于谁能把AI和业务平台焊在一起。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940w180k\">单点工具再强，也只解决一个环节的问题。<span textstyle=\"\">AI 能力跟业务平台打通，解决的是一整条链路——从信息输入到任务落地，从一次会议到持续跟进，全程不脱节</span>。会开完了，任务已经在路上了，决策到执行的链路从天缩短到秒。而且每一次会议、每一个决策，都自动沉淀成团队的知识资产，越用越聪明。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msmx940wgsz\">澜舟智会负责听和记，LangClaw 负责拆和干，两个能力合在一起，会议这件事才真正从\"开完就散\"变成\"开完就落地\"。对企业来说，这才是 AI 该带来的价值：<span textstyle=\"\">不是多了一个工具，而是少了一整条链路的人力消耗</span>。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">📌 想围观更多数字员工场景故事？</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">关注【澜舟科技】，回复关键词 \"入群\"，加入澜舟 Agent 用户群，每周解锁一个新场景。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">商务咨询👇</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"图片\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100030018\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3ccd2a005fd744f3ce6691e688735ca81786440608140.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"300\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3ccd2a005fd744f3ce6691e688735ca81786440608140.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><section data-nest-level=\"6\"><p data-nest-level=\"8\"><strong data-nest-level=\"9\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"10\">关于澜舟科技</span></strong></p></section><section data-nest-level=\"6\"><p data-nest-level=\"9\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"10\">ABOUT</span></p></section></section><section data-nest-level=\"5\"><p data-nest-level=\"10\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"11\">北京澜舟科技有限公司成立于2021年6月，孵化于创新工场，是中国最早以大模型为创业目标的企业之一，深耕认知智能领域，以全栈自研的孟子大模型为核心，基于可信智能体核心技术体系，构建起覆盖 LangClaw 企业智能体OS及智库、智会、智搭等产品的完整体系。</span></p></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"6\"><span textstyle=\"\">往期文章推荐</span></span></p><ul><li><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"ms4dv6iq1xo5\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mra95qrxgyq\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513674&idx=1&sn=ffc5e2e21241aab7605d3ba793a740f6&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"从流程自动化到认知智能化：LangClaw 携手澜舟智库打造业务决策型数字专家\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\">从流程自动化到认知智能化：LangClaw 携手澜舟智库打造业务决策型数字专家</span></a></span></p></li><li><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"ms4dv6iq1xo5\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mra95qrxgyq\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513641&idx=1&sn=033b016f022961ff40102f69328adc58&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"AI原生，可信为基——澜舟科技携LangClaw及三智产品矩阵重磅亮相WAIC 2026\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI原生，可信为基——澜舟科技携LangClaw及三智产品矩阵重磅亮相WAIC 2026</span></a></span></p></li><li><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"ms4dv6iq1dwg\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mra95qrxgyq\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513623&idx=1&sn=ef7e76f959fc047b26c0adad929d27ed&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"一份16.5小时的深度研报，现在15分钟就够了\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linkt