a-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513445&idx=1&sn=fd7d76145e877001a71bee7e7fe4a95e&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"澜舟科技发布可信 AI 技术体系，以智能体和数字员工重构企业服务新范式\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\">澜舟科技发布可信 AI 技术体系，以智能体和数字员工重构企业服务新范式</span></a></span></p></li><li><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513429&idx=1&sn=fa659d7f0df798d83fcc76e868ad3467&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"澜舟 x 影石重磅发布｜澜舟智会软硬一体化升级，解锁高效会议新体验\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\">澜舟 x 影石重磅发布｜澜舟智会软硬一体化升级，解锁高效会议新体验</span></a></span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513273&idx=1&sn=1332324f76fb63c6bb761dd1047292b6&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"不止于OpenClaw！澜舟科技企业级方案，直面AI落地3大痛点，共探增长新可能\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\">不止于OpenClaw！澜舟科技企业级方案，直面AI落地3大痛点，共探增长新可能</span></a></span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513164&idx=1&sn=3501a5b0a0a01101ed3621616ce0f4ff&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"客户案例｜智能合规助手赋能金融机构从“被动监管遵循” 向 “主动合规经营” 转变\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\">客户案例｜智能合规助手赋能金融机构从“被动监管遵循” 向 “主动合规经营” 转变</span></a></span></p></li><li><p data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MjY2ODI4Nw==&mid=2247513122&idx=1&sn=69cbf3193a38afd2f9594dd64b9d13bb&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"不止于大模型：澜舟科技企业智能体，让AI真正“懂业务、会执行”\" data-itemshowtype=